@InventoryService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5006

### Health Check
GET {{InventoryService_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Get All Inventory Stock
GET {{InventoryService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/inventory
Accept: application/json

### Get Single Product Stock
GET {{InventoryService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/inventory/PROD001
Accept: application/json

### Check Stock Availability
GET {{InventoryService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/inventory/check/PROD001?quantity=10
Accept: application/json

### Reduce Stock
POST {{InventoryService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/inventory/reduce
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "PROD001",
  "quantity": 5
}

### Process OrderCreatedEvent
POST {{InventoryService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/inventory/events/order-created
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "OrderCreated",
  "orderId": "ORD-1001",
  "productId": "PROD001",
  "quantity": 2
}
